  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water, then add a generous pinch of salt.\n• Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Cook potato in the boiling water over high heat, until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 mins. Drain and return to the pan.\n• Add the butter (for the mash) and milk to potato and season generously with salt. Mash until smooth.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13d6fe7bff1dd159f6a81/step-b8e79900.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot and zucchini into half-moons.\n• Roughly chop tomato and brown onion.\n• Drain and rinse cannellini beans.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot, zucchini and onion until tender, 4-5 mins. Add tomato and cook, stirring, until tender, 1-2 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13d6fe7bff1dd159f6a81/step-b914c710.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add beans, Nan’s special seasoning, Italian herbs, passata, the brown sugar, salt and a splash of water to the veggies and stir until combined.\n• Reduce heat to medium and cook until slightly thickened, 2-3 mins.\n• Remove pan from heat and stir through the butter (for the filling) until melted and combined. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13d6fe7bff1dd159f6a81/step-866e7020.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to high. Transfer filling to a baking dish and top evenly with mash.\n• Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese and grill until lightly golden, 5-8 mins.\n• Divide Tuscan white bean pie between plates to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13d6fe7bff1dd159f6a81/step-eee75130.jpeg"
    }
  ]
